SmartSlide AI - AI PPT Generator (single file: backend + frontend)

Run:   uvicorn app:app --reload --port 8000
Open:  http://127.0.0.1:8000

Needs Ollama running locally with the llama3.2 model:  ollama pull llama3.2
"""
